# SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-or-later
# Mustfile — Enaction Engine hard invariants

@abstract:
Release-blocking invariants for the implemented deterministic substrate,
canonical identity, licence posture, and honest architecture claims.
@end

## Deterministic substrate

### whole-steps-only
- description: Simulation support exposes whole equal steps; alpha is presentation-only
- run: cargo test --workspace
- severity: critical

### interpolation-render-only
- description: Documentation and host examples prohibit sampled values from re-entering simulation
- run: grep -q 'render-only' README.adoc && grep -q 'render interpolation never feeds simulation state' ARCHITECTURE.md
- severity: critical

### discontinuity-commit-then-snap
- description: Tests pin commit followed by snap for discontinuities
- run: cargo test --workspace commit_then_snap
- severity: critical

## Project identity

### workspace-crate
- description: The sole current workspace crate is enaction-time
- run: grep -q 'members = \["crates/enaction-time"\]' Cargo.toml && grep -q 'name = "enaction-time"' crates/enaction-time/Cargo.toml
- severity: critical

### canonical-repository
- description: Cargo repository metadata uses the canonical repository URL
- run: grep -q 'https://github.com/metadatastician/enaction-engine' Cargo.toml
- severity: critical

### no-speculative-crates
- description: The workspace must not contain empty aspirational subsystem crates
- run: test "$(find crates -mindepth 1 -maxdepth 1 -type d | wc -l)" -eq 1
- severity: critical

## Evidence and governance

### principal-documents
- description: README, EXPLAINME, architecture, roadmap, UMS integration, and ADRs exist
- run: test -f README.adoc && test -f EXPLAINME.adoc && test -f ARCHITECTURE.md && test -f docs/status/ROADMAP.adoc && test -f docs/architecture/UMS-INTEGRATION.adoc && test -f docs/decisions/0012-no-speculative-subsystems.adoc
- severity: critical

### licence-content
- description: Root licence remains the full GNU AGPL version 3 text
- run: grep -q 'GNU AFFERO GENERAL PUBLIC LICENSE' LICENSE
- severity: critical

### no-untracked-contractiles
- description: Contractile files are tracked before release
- run: test -z "$(git ls-files -o --exclude-standard .machine_readable/contractiles/)"
- severity: critical

### signed-release-commit
- description: A release commit must carry a valid Git signature
- run: git verify-commit HEAD
- severity: critical
